  "_artefact_committed_at_note": "The simulation-repo commit these bytes come from -- the last commit to touch that path, which is contract/PIN's definition of this field and is true of all four files here (measured: `git log -1` names 1f491340 for each of the four separately, not merely for the directory). It is NOT called `source_commit`, which is what the four asset pins use, and the difference is not cosmetic: `source_commit` there means the commit a VENDOR TOOL READ when it produced derived bytes, and no tool derived anything here. These are the committed bytes themselves, staged unchanged, so the field that says where they came to rest is the right one.",
